{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 1074, "capacity": 60, "raw_hex": "f0b2f299f8b2f194f171f8e1f484f7d12f2ff144f1d4f8b6f1bdf1adf984f154f0cff0c181432f2ff190f6baf9b2f26cfa7cfa99f16ff0cff184f7d1", "baseline_text": "이것이 원념의 힘…//가만히 싸우고 있다간，//짓눌려 버릴 것 같다고…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "これが、怨念の力……//黙って戦ってると、//押しつぶされそうだぜ……", "pointer_offset": 312, "unit": "dialogue:12fa2102f5abdded", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 432, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f266f18ef0a5f8a4f0adf1d5f0eff7d12f2ff0d8fa62f2ddfcabf16ff8f3f462f0f381432f2ff293f14af1b2f984f14bf8f4f16bf0aef9ccf2aff0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "걱정하지 마세요…//그런 강철 같은 몸은，//부수려고 해도 무리일 테니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "心配しなくても……//そんな鉄のような身体、//つぶそうとしても無理でしょう。", "pointer_offset": 316, "unit": "dialogue:f35dcce00cd4e00b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 507, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f0b1f144f148f8aaf247f8f4f2f5f0b4f14bf0a5f984f154f957f0f12f2ff387f388f1b5f15af0ef81b82f2ff0b5f244f244f244f24481b8", "baseline_text": "나가야스 씨도 곤란해하고 있는 게//틀림없어요∈//오호호호호∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "長安さんも困っているに//ちがいありませんわ！//おーっほほほっ∈", "pointer_offset": 320, "unit": "dialogue:38437ac80ad6e78f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 1143, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0bcf294f0c7f1c981b82f2ff8b2f1d1f0d3f8e4f16ff8f3f1bef0fa81b82f2ff949f576f1d9f984f144f1d4f8b6f154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "시끄러워∈//이 선인장 같은 여자∈//입 닥치고 가만히 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うるせぇ！//このサボテン女∈//黙って突っ立ってろ！", "pointer_offset": 324, "unit": "dialogue:f0ea33269c1b8af2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 621, "capacity": 78, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b8f0ef8143f144f1d4f8b6f154f8c8f94af1b5f15af0ef81b82f2ff0a4f17bf8e1f0b0f8b1f247f0a8f1c781432f2ff0a8f0b2f464f0b2f0a8f984fa57f14af8f4f1b5f0cff184f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "아니요，가만히 있을 수 없어요∈//지금의 칸나 씨라면，//라이벌이라고 할 수도 없다고요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "い～え、黙っていられませんわ！//今のカンナさんでは、//ライバルとは言えませんもの！", "pointer_offset": 328, "unit": "dialogue:5d11d6eda375d224", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 704, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f0aa8143f0aaf0abf0acf7d18148", "baseline_text": "스，스미레…？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "す、すみれ……？", "pointer_offset": 332, "unit": "dialogue:352362dac093d24f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 1196, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f2ddf4abf8e1f0dbf2a4f9d7f2ddf4abf8e1f0e1f0a4f0e72f2ff144f0a4f984f154f15af7d1", "baseline_text": "강철의 신체와 강철의 의지를//가지고 있어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "鉄の身体と鉄の意志を//持っている……", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:30e46b8636f5cc46", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 758, "capacity": 38, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0f1f7d12f2ff0dff944f2c9f984f154f1572f2ff0b0f8b1fa47f0aff3a0f144f0ef8148", "baseline_text": "그게…//제가 알고 있는//칸나 씨 아닌가요？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それが……//わたくしの知っている//カンナさんではなくて？", "pointer_offset": 340, "unit": "dialogue:fa341b5a69463b4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 815, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0aaf0abf0acf7d12f2ff0d8f27ef0f08143f0b1f7d12f2ff14ef97bf2d8f9a9f0adf2c3f8b2f1daf1f3f15a8144", "baseline_text": "스미레…//그렇네，나…//조금 약한 마음이 들었어．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "すみれ……//そうだな、あたい……//ちょっと弱気になってたよ。", "pointer_offset": 344, "unit": "dialogue:bd2601d4de4cd6d0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 876, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f8f0f263f0e2f0a3f14881442f2ff0d8f7d1f0d8f0c7f0b8f261f7d12f2ff1848143f184f461f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "네 말대로야．//그…그러니까…//고，고맙다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "お前の言うとおりだ。//その……なんだ……//あ、ありがとよ。", "pointer_offset": 348, "unit": "dialogue:cbd4cada8bca823b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 935, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0af8143f2c9f9c7f9fbf1c8f26bf0ef81442f2ff18ef263f0b2f0a48143f49df8b2f1b7f8b2f144f1572f2ff184f27cf8a8f1bef0faf0a8f0b8f261f0eff7d1", "baseline_text": "아，알면 된 거예요．//정말이지，손이 많이 가는//고릴라 여자라니까요…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わ、わかればいいのですわ。//本当に、手のかかる//ゴリラ女ですこと……", "pointer_offset": 352, "unit": "dialogue:b5ea50fe19c03e4d", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 1004, "capacity": 48, "raw_hex": "f1be8143f1bef14ff157f7d12f2ff360f0aff148f29ef0a481442f2ff2e8f8a4f4aaf242f8b2f991f144f0a4f1d4f7d1", "baseline_text": "여，여기는…//참아야겠지．//왠지 납득이 안 가지만…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "こ、ここは……//ガマンすべきだよな。//なんか納得いかないけど……", "pointer_offset": 356, "unit": "dialogue:116321f138c28a44", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04022.SBN", "offset": 1069, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 360, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
